
========================================================================
  PART 1: CORRECTED HOOK PRODUCT
========================================================================

  delta_k has boxes (i,j) with 0 <= i, 0 <= j, i+j <= k-1.
  Row i has (k-i) boxes: j = 0, 1, ..., k-i-1.
  h(i,j) = 2(k-i-j) - 1.

  Hook product = product over all boxes of h(i,j):
  = product_{i=0}^{k-1} product_{j=0}^{k-i-1} (2(k-i-j) - 1)

  k=1: hp = 1, hp_diag = 1, match = True
       = prod_{d=0}^{0} (2(1-d)-1)^{d+1}
       = prod_{m=1}^{1} (2m-1)^{1-m+1} = 1, match = True
  k=2: hp = 3, hp_diag = 3, match = True
       = prod_{d=0}^{1} (2(2-d)-1)^{d+1}
       = prod_{m=1}^{2} (2m-1)^{2-m+1} = 3, match = True
  k=3: hp = 45, hp_diag = 45, match = True
       = prod_{d=0}^{2} (2(3-d)-1)^{d+1}
       = prod_{m=1}^{3} (2m-1)^{3-m+1} = 45, match = True
  k=4: hp = 4725, hp_diag = 4725, match = True
       = prod_{d=0}^{3} (2(4-d)-1)^{d+1}
       = prod_{m=1}^{4} (2m-1)^{4-m+1} = 4725, match = True
  k=5: hp = 4465125, hp_diag = 4465125, match = True
       = prod_{d=0}^{4} (2(5-d)-1)^{d+1}
       = prod_{m=1}^{5} (2m-1)^{5-m+1} = 4465125, match = True
  k=6: hp = 46414974375, hp_diag = 46414974375, match = True
       = prod_{d=0}^{5} (2(6-d)-1)^{d+1}
       = prod_{m=1}^{6} (2m-1)^{6-m+1} = 46414974375, match = True
  k=7: hp = 6272287562165625, hp_diag = 6272287562165625, match = True
       = prod_{d=0}^{6} (2(7-d)-1)^{d+1}
       = prod_{m=1}^{7} (2m-1)^{7-m+1} = 6272287562165625, match = True

  CORRECT FORMULA: hook_prod(k) = prod_{m=1}^{k} (2m-1)^{k-m+1}
  = 1^k * 3^{k-1} * 5^{k-2} * ... * (2k-1)^1
  The exponents DECREASE from k down to 1.

  COMPARE with wrong formula (S164a): prod_{d=1}^{k} (2d-1)^d
  The wrong formula had exponents INCREASING from 1 to k.

  CORRECTED f^delta_k:
  k=1: f^delta = 1! / 1 = 1
  k=2: f^delta = 3! / 3 = 2
  k=3: f^delta = 6! / 45 = 16
  k=4: f^delta = 10! / 4725 = 768
  k=5: f^delta = 15! / 4465125 = 292864
  k=6: f^delta = 21! / 46414974375 = 1100742656
  k=7: f^delta = 28! / 6272287562165625 = 48608795688960

